# No auto-imports

`imports.autoImport` is `false`. Always import:

- Vue APIs (`ref`, `computed`, `watch`, …) from `vue`
- Nuxt helpers from `#imports` — including compiler macros (`defineAppConfig`, `definePageMeta`, `defineNuxtRouteMiddleware`, `defineNuxtPlugin`)
- Stores from `@/stores/...`
- Utils from `@/utils/...`

`app/app.config.ts` must import `defineAppConfig` from `#imports`. Omitting it passes lint and unit tests, then fails `pnpm build:vercel` prerender with `defineAppConfig is not defined`.
